<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01264#self_deprecating_joke> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses self-deprecating humor by implying that the viewer (or the squirrel) is 'a special kinda nuts,' which is a lighthearted, non-harmful way to acknowledge eccentricity or odd behavior. This type of humor relies on social understanding of humor and the acceptability of making light of one's own quirks."@en .
