<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01264#squirrel_behavior_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Squirrels are often associated with being 'nuts' in popular culture and idiomatic expressions, such as 'nuts' meaning crazy or eccentric. This association is not literal but is a cultural stereotype that makes the pun in the meme effective. The image of the squirrel is used to visually represent this stereotype."@en .
